 {
  "key": "p02",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "INTRODUCTION"
   ],
   [
    "Receptionists serve as the first point",
    "of contact for the firm. They will",
    "encounter different types of callers",
    "such as insurance adjusters, lawyers",
    "from opposing counsel, staff from",
    "health providers, and clients so",
    "maintaining professionalism and a",
    "smile throughout the shift is a must."
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p03",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "INTRODUCTION"
   ],
   [
    "They should be on a ready status",
    "once the shift starts as there might",
    "be callers who need to contact us as",
    "soon as possible."
   ],
   [
    "They are responsible for answering",
    "calls and relaying messages from",
    "the caller to the intended recipient",
    "and vice versa."
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p04",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "INTRODUCTION"
   ],
   [
    "They are also responsible for saving",
    "documents sent to the firm via",
    "facsimile or electronic mail."
   ],
   [
    "They track all calls and saved",
    "documents by saving them into the",
    "LSH tracker."
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
