 {
  "key": "p08",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "INQUIRIES ON FIRM’S SERVICES"
   ],
   [
    "A lead is any prospect who has",
    "expressed interest in your firm’s",
    "legal services."
   ],
   [
    "Typically it calls for this potential",
    "client to share their email or other",
    "personal contact information with",
    "you."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p09",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "INQUIRIES ON FIRM’S SERVICES"
   ],
   [
    "After verifying on a surface level",
    "that the caller is a potential client",
    "then transfer them to the right",
    "department."
   ],
   [
    "Don’t forget to apply necessary",
    "procedures before transferring",
    "the call."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p10",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "EXISTING CLIENT",
    "INQUIRIES"
   ],
   [
    "Clients' queries include case",
    "updates, loan/payment inquiries,",
    "medical appointments,",
    "transportation, and attorney",
    "communication or callbacks."
   ],
   [
    "Get the first and last name of the",
    "client (make sure the spelling is",
    "correct) and Date of Loss /",
    "Accident then Search for a project",
    "in CRM/CMS."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p11",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "EXISTING CLIENT",
    "INQUIRIES"
   ],
   [
    "If no case appears, check whether",
    "the caller is contacting us on",
    "behalf of a client, such as a",
    "parent, child, sibling, or partner.",
    "Verify the name associated with",
    "the case."
   ],
   [
    "If records are found, keep all",
    "information confidential. Check",
    "the Case Type, Case Manager,",
    "and Claims Assistant to",
    "coordinate the call and verify the",
    "caller’s authorization."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p12",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "SALES & SOCIAL",
    "ENGINEERING CALLS"
   ],
   [
    "A sales call is an unsolicited",
    "phone call that a salesperson",
    "makes to a prospective firm to",
    "generate business."
   ],
   [
    "These calls can be either be cold",
    "calls or a scheduled call. These",
    "calls could range from product",
    "offers to any legal services.",
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p13",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "SALES & SOCIAL",
    "ENGINEERING CALLS"
   ],
   [
    "Common tactics:"
   ],
   [
    "Claiming “prior meetings”",
    "Pretending to know the attorneys",
    "Selling AI, marketing, or PI litigation convention",
    "tickets",
    "Using robocalls or spam messages to bypass",
    "receptionists or pressure for a response"
   ],
   [
    "Proper Handling:"
   ],
   [
    "Do not transfer unsolicited calls, human or",
    "automated.",
    "Request follow-up by email.",
    "Take a message only if they claim to have an",
    "appointment.",
    "Add persistent callers to the Do-Not-Call list.",
    "For robocalls/spam, identify, ignore, and block;",
    "log as needed for tracking or compliance."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p14",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "OPPOSING",
    "COUNSEL"
   ],
   [
    "One of the most important rules",
    "of ethics that lawyers must abide",
    "by is not communicating with the",
    "opposing parties who are",
    "represented by counsel."
   ],
   [
    "This rule extends to paralegals",
    "and case assistants too. You",
    "should never tell them any",
    "information without the direct",
    "permission of your supervising",
    "lawyer.",
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p15",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "OPPOSING",
    "COUNSEL"
   ],
   [
    "Confirm with the attorneys, case",
    "managers or their paralegals if",
    "you are allowed to speak to any",
    "of the opposing counsel party."
   ],
   [
    "Depending on your firm’s SOPs,",
    "follow their instructions and",
    "always ask for advise before",
    "proceeding with anything."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p16",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "OPPOSING",
    "COUNSEL"
   ],
   [
    "Confirm that the caller is a",
    "licensed attorney before taking",
    "any action."
   ],
   [
    "Do not discuss case facts under",
    "any circumstances."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p17",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "OPPOSING",
    "COUNSEL"
   ],
   [
    "Either transfer the call to the",
    "appropriate attorney/paralegal or",
    "take a detailed message."
   ],
   [
    "Tag the attorney or paralegal in the",
    "CRM to ensure proper follow-up",
    "and tracking.",
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p18",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "MEDICAL",
    "PROVIDERS"
   ],
   [
    "Medical facility inquiries may",
    "include case status, representation",
    "confirmation, claim information,",
    "appointments, client inquiries, and",
    "callbacks regarding bills or",
    "records requests."
   ],
   [
    "Do not share any client’s",
    "information that are not asked for.",
    "Confirm with the Attorney what",
    "information you are allowed to",
    "disclose or where to direct this",
    "kind of calls."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p19",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "COURT",
    "STAFF"
   ],
   [
    "Court staff members can call the",
    "firm regarding litigation cases",
    "either to provide information or",
    "talk to your firm’s litigation",
    "department regarding",
    "government scheduled mandates."
   ],
   [
    "Always refer to the correct staff",
    "member to assist them",
    "appropriately."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p20",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "COURT",
    "STAFF"
   ],
   [
    "Treat as urgent and attempt live",
    "or warm transfer"
   ],
   [
    "If attorney unavailable:"
   ],
   [
    "Supervising attorney",
    "Paralegal",
    "Immediate callback",
    "coordination"
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
