  "boxes": [
   [
    "INSURANCE",
    "COMPANIES"
   ],
   [
    "Aside from the information you",
    "will ask at the onset of the call,",
    "ALWAYS ASK for a CLAIM",
    "NUMBER and DOL when receiving",
    "a call from Insurance Companies."
   ],
   [
    "Insurance companies will always",
    "ask for index information of",
    "clients (such as DOB, SSN which",
