    "law firm). WE DO NOT GIVE THAT",
    "INFORMATION EVER!"
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p22",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "INSURANCE",
    "COMPANIES"
   ],
   [
    "Insurance adjuster inquiries may involve",
    "demand responses, settlement offers,",
    "liability decisions, client questions, IMEs,",
    "recorded statements, demand",
    "extensions, affidavit waivers, and case",
    "status updates."
   ],
   [
    "If unsure of what to tell the caller, offer a",
    "callback and confirm first with your",
    "supervising attorney or case manager if",
    "you are allowed to disclose information",
    "or where to direct this kind of calls."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p23",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "INSURANCE",
    "COMPANIES"
   ],
   [
    "If they give you a hard time on the",
    "phone you can let them know it’s",
    "the firm’s policy."
   ],
   [
    "Any requests should be sent in",
    "written form via Fax or Mail.",
    "Always check your firm’s SOPs",
    "before sharing anything with the",
    "insurance adjusters."
   ],
   [
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p24",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "OTHER",
    "PARTIES"
   ],
   [
    "Be cautious when speaking with",
    "witnesses, as ethical rules govern",
    "communications with represented",
    "opposing parties."
   ],
   [
    "Generally, a lawyer may not",
    "communicate with someone",
    "known to be represented by",
    "another lawyer, except in limited",
    "circumstances.",
    "RECEPTIONIST ROLE"
   ]
  ],
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "key": "p25",
  "boxes": [
   [
    "OTHER",
    "PARTIES"
   ],
   [
    "Generally the prohibition against",
    "contact with a represented party",
    "extends to any party represented",
    "by counsel, and not just the",
    "adversary."
   ],
